>Employee Onboarding</h5><p _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="">Simplify employee onboarding with integrated HR management. Set up multiple office locations, departments, designations, and streamline the onboarding process for new hires.</p></div><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="col-md-3 col-lg-3 col-xl-3 text-center my-3 hrmFeatureBox"><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="big-circle_4"><img _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" src="assets/main/4.png" alt=""></div><h5 _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="hrmFeature py-2 text-center">Payroll</h5><p _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="">Organize payroll tasks efficiently with automated salary slip generation and CTC calculations, ensuring accurate and timely employee payments.</p></div><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="col-md-3 col-lg-3 col-xl-3 text-center my-3 hrmFeatureBox"><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="big-circle_5"><img _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" src="assets/main/5.png" alt=""></div><h5 _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="hrmFeature py-2 text-center">Expense Management</h5><p _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="">Streamline expense reporting with easy-to-use modules that sync with employee reporting managers for seamless approval processes. Define expense policies, track expenses, and optimize expenditures. </p></div><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="col-md-3 col-lg-3 col-xl-3 text-center my-3 hrmFeatureBox"><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="big-circle_6"><img _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" src="assets/main/6.png" alt=""></div><h5 _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="hrmFeature py-2 text-center">Attendance Management</h5><p _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="">Adapt to complex labor environments with automated attendance tracking and comprehensive reporting features. Manage time logs, approvals, and off-site worker attendance effortlessly.</p></div><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="col-md-3 col-lg-3 col-xl-3 text-center my-3 hrmFeatureBox"><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="big-circle_7"><img _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" src="assets/main/7.png" alt=""></div><h5 _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="hrmFeature py-2 text-center">Leave Management</h5><p _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="">Customize leave policies and structures, automate leave approvals, and manage leave entitlements with ease. Configure different templates and workflows to suit departmental requirements.</p></div><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="col-md-3 col-lg-3 col-xl-3 text-center my-3 hrmFeatureBox"><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="big-circle_8"><img _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" src="assets/main/8.png" alt=""></div><h5 _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="hrmFeature py-2 text-center">Recruitment System</h5><p _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="">Simplify recruitment processes with EffortlessHRM's intuitive features for job requisition, candidate engagement, collaboration, and onboarding.</p></div><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="col-md-3 col-lg-3 col-xl-3 text-center my-3 hrmFeatureBox"><div _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="big-circle_9"><img _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" src="assets/main/9.png" alt=""></div><h5 _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="" class="hrmFeature py-2 text-center">Interview Process</h5><p _ngcontent-a-c3310946234="">Create custom templates to streamline candidate data storage, interview scheduling, and feedback collection. Conduct interviews online and efficiently manage the entire recruitment process.</p></div></div></div></section>}
